      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS BEJEWELED (6) resumes from a spell of nine weeks after closing off last campaign in good form, the last run being a solid second over 2100m at Bunbury. Likely to run a big race to kick off this campaign. MAAS ATTACK (5) finished sixth last start over 1780m at Northam, beaten 18 metres, after a good third at Northam the run prior. Won't find this any harder and she can bounce back straight away. NOT SO SWEET (8) finished ninth two runs ago then broke and finished a long last over 2130m at this track at the latest appearance. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position, but is a live chance in a similar assignment. SHEZABECA (4) is better than her last-start seventh over 2242m at Narrogin. Next best.",
